# SHA-256 of the prebuilt frameworks committed under addons/godot-iap/bin/.
# CI builds them with Xcode 26.6 (job `apple-frameworks` in ci-godot-iap.yml)
# and uploads them as an artifact; the maintainer commits that artifact.
# `bun run audit:godot-binaries` verifies the committed files against this
# manifest — the release runs it as a deploy gate
# (release-godot.yml validate-ios) and CI re-runs it on main/next pushes and
# PRs to fail earlier. macOS digests pin pre-signing bytes: notarized
# releases re-sign those frameworks before zipping, so shipped macOS bytes
# differ by design.
#
# Regenerate after an intentional rebuild:
#   node scripts/audit-godot-binary-digests.mjs --write
86b74b8d7008b6324ea74603d7d6f337aaecbc8ff961c03e1313b290d0343169  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
f4b77a538c99db433737bb99238a1808baf12c6b2919e34bc53b9202a8400e39  addons/godot-iap/bin/ios/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
5b51e50e62f91983a5bb9044c3a4b12a6410dff8cffbe4d4d95e5aadaaaadb7b  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/GodotIap.framework/GodotIap
2c67994fb12fba86dcc98004cb06ead529e72d2069f6216e2d49d01d5bfad983  addons/godot-iap/bin/macos/SwiftGodotRuntime.framework/SwiftGodotRuntime
